    'Po: you must solve this for exactly one person, forever',
    'Po: the budget is zero and the deadline is tomorrow',
    'Po: the budget is infinite and nobody may be hired',
    'Po: the problem must get worse before anyone is allowed to fix it',
    'Po: the people affected design the solution; you only veto',
    'Po: whatever you ship must work with everyone asleep',
    'Po: the solution must be explainable to a nine-year-old in one sentence',
    'Po: you may only remove things, never add them',
    'Po: the opposite of your current approach is mandated by law',
    'Po: your fiercest competitor is put in charge of this problem',
    'Po: the solution must be embarrassing to announce',
    'Po: this problem is actually the symptom; the cause is upstream of your team',
    'Po: you must charge money for the thing you currently give away',
    'Po: the fix must survive being run backwards',
    'Po: every stakeholder swaps roles with the one they trust least',
    'Po: the slowest part is declared the most valuable part',
    'Po: you solve it without the tool you reach for first',
    'Po: the failure you fear most is scheduled, on purpose, next week',
